# =========================================================================================== #
# File: '.gitignore'
# --- [ Description ] ----------------------------------------------------------------------- #
#
# DEFAULT-DENY. Nothing in this working tree is tracked unless it is explicitly allowed
# below. Adding a new file therefore requires allowing it here first — that is deliberate:
# it makes publishing a file an explicit act rather than an accident.
#
# =========================================================================================== #

# Ignore everything ...
**
# ... but keep descending into directories so the allowances below can still match.
!**/

# --- [ allowed: repository configuration ] -------------------------------------------------- #
!/.editorconfig
!/.framework-pin
!/.gitignore
!/.yamllint.yml

# --- [ allowed: top-level documents ] ------------------------------------------------------- #
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/LICENSE
!/README.md

# --- [ allowed: the product tree ] ---------------------------------------------------------- #
!/.github/**
!/ansible/**
!/scripts/**
!/terraform/**

# --- [ allowed: published documentation ] --------------------------------------------------- #
# Enumerated rather than a wildcard: local working notes live alongside these on disk and
# must never be published by default.
!/docs/KEY-RELOAD.md
!/docs/TECH-DEBT.md
!/docs/VM-LIFECYCLE.md
!/docs/ansible-style-guide.md
!/docs/reference/**

# --- [ never tracked, even inside an allowed tree ] ----------------------------------------- #
# Composition build tree (framework checkout + overlaid roles) and build worktrees.
/.compose/
/.worktrees/

# Scratch and secrets — never commit credentials.
*.retry
*.log
*.secret
temp-password*
